# BORGHERTZS_DRAGON_HANDS (jeuno 57): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job DRG, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 DRG: IfritsCauldron's Treasure Coffer opens to DrachenMail
# (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +134217728 (bit 27); QuicksandCaves's to DrachenGreaves:
# +268435456 (bit 28).
lists IfritsCauldron/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade QuicksandCaves/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=IfritsCauldron pos=118.8,20.0,141.8 job=DRG lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsDragonHands accepted
item CauldronCofferKey
item QuicksandCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer CauldronCofferKey x1 # bit 27 unset: DrachenMail; [AF]ZilartCoffer 134217728
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -144.9,1.9,448.1 QuicksandCaves
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer QuicksandCofferKey x1 # bit 28 unset: DrachenGreaves; [AF]ZilartCoffer 402653184
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
